<title>USA: Alexandria sets dividend for part of quarter.</title>
<headline>Alexandria sets dividend for part of quarter.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA, Calif. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alexandria Real Estate Equities Inc said Monday it has declared a cash dividend of $0.1275 per share for the partial calendar quarter ended June 30.</p>
<p>The company said the dividend for the partial calendar quarter equates to a regular quarterly dividend rate of 40 cents per share, or $1.60 per share annualized.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid on July 18 to shareholders of record on July 7.</p>
<p>The company said it completed its initial public offering on June 2.</p>
